boundaries,\\nbut remove flush and fetch-validity gating from the data payload flops.\\nSplit the current whole-struct ID/EX assignment into payload update and\\ncontrol/valid/prediction update logic, retaining a single owner for each register bit.\\n\\nOn reset clear every field exactly as today. Outside reset, update PC,\\ninstruction, immediate, rs1/rs2 values and addresses, alu_a/alu_b, rd and direct_targ\n…[5949 of 9021 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:37a981d1ac0ec43c]…\nmhz\": 93.817, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4296444, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3675, \"ff\": 1090, \"seeds\": [90.815, 93.817, 93.817], \"perturbations\": [[0, 90.815, 10], [1, 93.817, 13], [2, 93.817, 13]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_a_30_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_b_7_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -6.011, \"arrival_ns\": 16.306, \"logic_cells\": 10, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 10, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T19:10:16.352646Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 5, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-003-r5s2 (improvement, +5.21%): Keeping full reset but limiting ID/EX flush/invalid-fetch clearing to ctrl_t, valid and predicted_taken while preserving payload stall holds reduces recovery muxing and fanout, improving Fmax and LUT use with unchanged CoreMark cycles.\"}\n./cores/bench/experiments/run_summary.json\n./tools/eval/test_fpga_report.py\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
