parallel with data arrival, decode two scalar controls:\\n  xor_en = (op == ALU_OR) || (op == ALU_XOR)\\n  and_en = (op == ALU_OR) || (op == ALU_AND)\\nFor each bit i, compute\\n  logic_result[i] = ((a[i] ^ b[i]) & xor_en)\\n                  | ((a[i] & b[i]) & and_en).\\nThis has exactly four independent inputs per bit\n…[85043 of 88115 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:ce2bc2a76b2185d2]…\ngister ALU-B and\\nimmediate instructions whose raw rs2 bits alias live producers,\\nincluding x0, load-use bubbles, independent imem/dmem stalls,\\narithmetic waits and redirects. Require unchanged scheduling and\\narchitectural rs2_val, and final ALU-B equivalence at each capture.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 183.32, \"delta_pct\": -16.05, \"vs_baseline\": 1412.54, \"fmax_mhz\": 78.763, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4296444, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3717, \"ff\": 1090, \"seeds\": [81.526, 78.763, 78.763], \"perturbations\": [[0, 81.526, 13], [1, 78.763, 13], [2, 78.763, 13]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_b_30_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -7.266, \"arrival_ns\": 17.56, \"logic_cells\": 38, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_mul\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T23:26:38.495861Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 10}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
