e':'test/test_alu.py','description':'''Retain all existing real and ALTOPS checks. Add exact AND/OR/XOR vectors using zero/all-ones, alternating masks, walking-one/walking-zero operands and deterministic random pairs. Alternate these operations on fixed operands and interleave shifts/add/sub/M-extension opcodes to catch stale or overlapping family enables. Check opcodes outside the family retain their existing results.'''}\n]}\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,default_flow_style=False,width=84))\njsonschema.validate(d,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Refined schema-valid micro_opt hypothesis:',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Refined schema-valid micro_opt hypothesis: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261002-001-r6s0.yaml\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
