ian Fmax of 5.442 MHz. alu.sv expresses\\nDIV, DIVU, REM and REMU as separate signed/unsigned division and remainder\\noperators. Their combinational implementation is the strongest suspected\\nsource of the deep arithmetic path and substantial LUT usage. A smaller,\\nexplicitly shared divider can improve the timed circuit even when CoreMark\\nis executing other operations, because the full\n…[237384 of 240456 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:4c6c4d7eb610d5f1]…\nlookahead predictions on trained loops, consecutive branches,\\ncorrection onto another branch, JAL/JALR and independent bus/arithmetic\\nholds. Adapt only predictor-specific warmup timing expectations if\\nneeded; verify accepted prediction metadata and no wrong-path stores.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 192.17, \"delta_pct\": -11.99, \"vs_baseline\": 1485.56, \"fmax_mhz\": 82.615, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4298982, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3677, \"ff\": 1091, \"seeds\": [77.578, 82.615, 82.615], \"perturbations\": [[0, 77.578, 13], [1, 82.615, 13], [2, 82.615, 13]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_div/state_q_0_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -7.89, \"arrival_ns\": 18.185, \"logic_cells\": 38, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_mul\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_div\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T21:33:15.176210Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 8}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
