des, and performs one radix-2 restoring\\ndivision step per cycle using a registered partial remainder, quotient,\\ndivisor, and a bounded counter. Share the magnitude datapath between signed\\nand unsigned operations and between quotient and remainder; register sign\\ncorrection before presenting the result. A normal division takes about\\n34-35 cycles including prepara\n…[92236 of 95308 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:69df0f6a78d279ba]…\nand back-to-back multiply issue, exactly one bubble for immediate dependent consumers, competing writers, high-half results, x0, memory stalls, older multiply completion during younger divide/recovery and reset. Require exact RVFI operands/results/PC/order and no repeated or wrong-path memory effects.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 206.64, \"delta_pct\": -5.37, \"vs_baseline\": 1604.95, \"fmax_mhz\": 87.585, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4238604, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3614, \"ff\": 1023, \"seeds\": [83.893, 87.585, 87.585], \"perturbations\": [[0, 83.893, 13], [1, 87.585, 12], [2, 87.585, 12]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_a_7_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -6.92, \"arrival_ns\": 17.214, \"logic_cells\": 38, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T20:59:29.111819Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 7}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
