tion-to-PC timing. Keep target and PC+4\n  additions parallel and select their completed addresses.\n\n  Reset direction_q to 2'b01. On an accepted EX redirect also set it to\n  2'b01 while the PC takes redirect_target with its existing priority.\n  This explicit weakly-not-taken f\n…[3001 of 6073 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:fbf719e64ef6866e]…\n edge. Reset and redirect\n      set it to weakly not taken. Preserve direct JAL prediction, targets,\n      table size/reset/training/saturation, raw instruction validity and\n      PC reset/redirect/stall priority; add no fetch stage or outcome bypass.\n  - file: test/test_if_stage.py\n    description: |\n      Extend fetch tests with a cycle-accurate lookahead-counter model,\n      held-PC refresh, old-data same-edge training behavior, reset and\n      redirect fallback, consecutive branches and aliasing. Preserve all\n      instruction qualification, target/alignment and PC-priority checks.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Retain exact retirement/result/trap/order and side-effect assertions.\n      Exercise lookahead predictions on trained loops, consecutive branches,\n      correction onto another branch, JAL/JALR and independent bus/arithmetic\n      holds. Adapt only predictor-specific warmup timing expectations if\n      needed; verify accepted prediction metadata and no wrong-path stores.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
