{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"agent_message","text":"The broader predecode also regressed despite passing its checks. I’ll exclude it from the final proposal and make one last check of a dedicated branch comparator, which addresses the recurring long branch-control path without adding registers."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path('cores/bench'); bak=root/'generated/r13-backup'\nfor p in bak.rglob('*'):\n if p.is_file(): (root/p.relative_to(bak)).write_bytes(p.read_bytes())\np=root/'rtl/ex_stage.sv';s=p.read_text()\na=s.index('  always_comb begin\\\\n    case (in.ctrl.branch_op)')\ns=s[:a]+'''  logic [30:0] branch_eq, branch_lt;\n  always_comb begin\n    for (int i=0; i<16; i++) begin\n      branch_eq[15+i] = rs1[2*i +: 2] == rs2[2*i +: 2];\n      branch_lt[15+i] = rs1[2*i +: 2] < rs2[2*i +: 2];\n    end\n    for (int i=14; i>=0; i--) begin\n      branch_eq[i] = branch_eq[2*i+2] & branch_eq[2*i+1];\n      branch_lt[i] = branch_lt[2*i+2] | (branch_eq[2*i+2] & branch_lt[2*i+1]);\n    end\n  end\n  logic branch_less_signed;\n  assign branch_less_signed = (rs1[31] \"'^ rs2[31]) ? rs1[31] : branch_lt[0];\n\n'\"'''+s[a:]\ns=s.replace('branch_cond = (rs1 == rs2)', 'branch_cond = branch_eq[0]').replace('branch_cond = (rs1 \"'!= rs2)'\"', 'branch_cond = \"'!branch_eq[0]'\"').replace('branch_cond = (\"'$signed(rs1) <  $signed(rs2))'\"', 'branch_cond = branch_less_signed').replace('branch_cond = (\"'$signed(rs1) >= $signed(rs2))'\"', 'branch_cond = \"'!branch_less_signed'\"').replace('branch_cond = (rs1 <  rs2)', 'branch_cond = branch_lt[0]').replace('branch_cond = (rs1 >= rs2)', 'branch_cond = \"'!branch_lt[0]'\"')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
