ells at a median Fmax of 5.442 MHz. alu.sv expresses\\nDIV, DIVU, REM and REMU as separate signed/unsigned division and remainder\\noperators. Their combinational implementation is the strongest suspected\\nsource of the deep arithmetic path and substantial LUT usage. A smaller,\\nexplicitly shared divider can improve the timed circuit even when CoreMark\\nis executing other operations, because the full\n…[427854 of 430926 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:170ad7253a561805]…\n\"Retain all existing assertions and add consecutive same-index branch\\nupdates under deterministic bus/interlock holds. Check exact accepted\\npredictions, training and RVFI order, single training per EX advance,\\ncorrection priority, traps and absence of wrong-path memory effects.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 206.51, \"delta_pct\": -5.43, \"vs_baseline\": 1603.88, \"fmax_mhz\": 88.724, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4296444, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3545, \"ff\": 1090, \"seeds\": [87.939, 88.724, 88.724], \"perturbations\": [[0, 87.939, 9], [1, 88.724, 12], [2, 88.724, 12]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_a_10_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs1_val_13_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -6.371, \"arrival_ns\": 16.666, \"logic_cells\": 9, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 9, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T01:40:38.636113Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 13}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
