49.74 cycles 4491817 Remove redirect-driven payload muxes from fetch and decode\npath {'from': 'cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s', 'to': 'dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s', 'slack_ns': -15.387, 'arrival_ns': 25.682, 'logic_cells': 13, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_id', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu', 'cpu/u_ex']}\nhyp-20261002-002-r2s1 structural regression fitness 108.75 fmax 52.0 cycles 4781572 Register the fetch-to-decode boundary to break redirect feedback\npath {'from': 'cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_3_s0', 'to': 'dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s', 'slack_ns': -14.261, 'arr\n…[11300 of 14372 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:e33ed5569ef7f7ea]…\n propagation with a sparse four-bit-group prefix\npath {'from': 'cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_a_2_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_28_s0', 'slack_ns': -9.013, 'arrival_ns': 19.307, 'logic_cells': 14, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_id']}\nhyp-20261003-002-r13s1 structural regression fitness 181.87 fmax 78.139 cycles 4296444 Retime branch comparison leaves across the operand register boundary\npath {'from': 'cpu/u_id/reg_q.ctrl.alu_op_1_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_9_s0', 'slack_ns': -7.431, 'arrival_ns': 17.725, 'logic_cells': 14, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_fwd', 'cpu/u_id']}\nhyp-20261003-003-r13s2 predictor regression fitness 206.51 fmax 88.724 cycles 4296444 Counter-local BHT training removes the indexed read-modify-write loop\npath {'from': 'cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_a_10_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs1_val_13_s0', 'slack_ns': -6.371, 'arrival_ns': 16.666, 'logic_cells': 9, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_id']}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
