{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"agent_message","text":"The fall-through queue cuts timed cycles by 6.67%, but still loses too much Fmax. I’m finishing with a narrower structural proposal: register small branch-comparison leaves alongside the resolved operands, then combine them in EX. This targets the recurring branch carry chain while preserving execution latency and the current forwarding network."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport shutil\nroot=Path('/srv/hwebench/tmp/6b356b5e/1b6202c7/branch_leaf_retime');shutil.copytree('cores/bench/rtl',root/'rtl',dirs_exist_ok=True)\np=root/'rtl/core_pkg.sv';s=p.read_text().replace('    logic [31:0] imm;','    logic [15:0] branch_eq_leaves;\\\\n    logic [15:0] branch_lt_leaves;\\\\n    logic [31:0] imm;',1);p.write_text(s)\np=root/'rtl/id_stage.sv';s=p.read_text().replace('        reg_q.imm      <= imm;', '''        reg_q.imm      <= imm;\n        for (int i=0; i<16; i++) begin\n          reg_q.branch_eq_leaves[i] <= rs1_value[i*2 +: 2] == rs2_value[i*2 +: 2];\n          reg_q.branch_lt_leaves[i] <= rs1_value[i*2 +: 2] < rs2_value[i*2 +: 2];\n        end''',1);p.write_text(s)\np=root/'rtl/ex_stage.sv';s=p.read_text();at='  // ── Branch resolve '\npos=s.index(at);s=s[:pos]+'''  wire [15:0] eq_level [0:4];\n  wire [15:0] lt_level [0:4];\n  assign eq_level[0] = in.branch_eq_leaves;\n  assign lt_level[0] = in.branch_lt_leaves;\n  generate\n    for (genvar level=0; level<4; level++) begin: cmp_level\n      for (genvar item=0; item<(16 >> (level+1)); item++) begin: cmp_item\n        assign eq_level[level+1][item] = eq_level[level][2*item+1] && eq_level[level][2*item];\n        assign lt_level[level+1][item] = lt_level[level][2*item+1]\n                    || (eq_level[level][2*item+1] && lt_level[level][2*item]);\n      end\n    end\n  endgenerate\n  wire equal_branch = eq_level[4][0];\n  wire unsigned_less_branch = lt_level[4][0];\n  wire signed_less_branch = (rs1[31] \"'^ rs2[31]) ? rs1[31] : unsigned_less_branch;\n'\"'''+s[pos:]\ns=s.replace('(rs1 == rs2)','equal_branch').replace('(rs1 \"'!= rs2)'\"','\"'!equal_branch'\"').replace('(\"'$signed(rs1) <  $signed(rs2))'\"','signed_less_branch').replace('(\"'$signed(rs1) >= $signed(rs2))'\"','\"'!signed_less_branch'\"').replace('(rs1 <  rs2)','unsigned_less_branch')