 integrated\\ntwo-bit saturating direction counter. Index with fetch PC[7:2]; retain\\nthe full PC[31:8] tag, a word-aligned 30-bit target, a conditional versus\\nunconditional type bit, and a valid bit. A matching unconditional entry\\npredicts its cached target; a conditional entry predicts that target\\nwhen the counter MSB is set. A miss or not-ta\n…[315967 of 319039 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:57fde73d2090d292]…\nnly stack actions on accepted EX jumps.\\n\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_if_stage.py\", \"description\": \"Add a focused return-stack model covering masking of uninitialized\\nentries, canonical predecode, overflow/underflow, simultaneous fetch\\nand updates, reset and fetch holds, with exact prediction comparisons.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 210.39, \"delta_pct\": -3.65, \"vs_baseline\": 1635.89, \"fmax_mhz\": 90.089, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4282066, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3817, \"ff\": 1137, \"seeds\": [85.21, 90.089, 90.089], \"perturbations\": [[0, 85.21, 10], [1, 90.089, 10], [2, 90.089, 10]], \"lutram\": 48, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_a_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -6.736, \"arrival_ns\": 17.03, \"logic_cells\": 10, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 10, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T00:12:57.304224Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 11}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
